No Transformers modeling implementation is copied into this package. Runtime
modeling, configuration, tokenizer, image processor and video processor classes
are imported directly from the installed Apache-2.0 Transformers distribution.
The Qwen2-VL implementation credits the Qwen team and Hugging Face Inc.

Pinned Qwen/Qwen2-VL-2B-Instruct configuration, tokenizer and processor metadata
are retained as offline regression data in compressed JSON. Copyright the Qwen
team, Alibaba Cloud. The accompanying LICENSE is preserved verbatim from that
checkpoint revision. The hf-tiny-v2 text config and safetensors shape metadata
describe a public randomly initialized Transformers test artifact, not trained
model weights. Revisions, source paths and hashes are recorded in README.md and
provenance.json. No trained tensor payload is included.
